msgstr "文章 meta 查詢索引"

#: includes/class-minimal-admin-db.php:802
msgid "Present"
msgstr "存在"

#: includes/class-minimal-admin-db.php:804
msgid "A combined post_id and meta_key index is present, so meta lookups stay fast."
msgstr "已存在 post_id 與 meta_key 的組合索引，因此 meta 查詢保持快速。"

#: includes/class-minimal-admin-db.php:805
